This project includes work derived from WeDLM (Tencent):
https://github.com/tencent/WeDLM

The portable alodlm/ implementation adapts attention, masking, recurrence,
training objectives, generation, and answer extraction from WeDLM.
The optimized/wedlm/ package includes the inference engine with adaptive
recurrence, depth-aware KV caching, committed-token feedback, and CUDA graphs.
See optimized/NOTICE for the engine's modification and dependency notices.

The complete supplied WeDLM terms and nano-vllm MIT attribution are retained
in optimized/licenses/WeDLM.txt, including the territorial restriction.
This shared copy covers the WeDLM-derived material in both implementations.
This release does not replace those upstream terms.

Model weights are distributed separately and retain their own licenses.
